    description: Some("Pick from four wrestlers — Mad Dog, Skin Head, Mr. Mean and Big Chief — and fight one-on-one or as a tag team, against a second player or the computer. Power bars on the scoreboard track both wrestlers\' strength, and you have to drain your opponent\'s while holding on to your own before a three-count pin will stick; best of three falls takes the belt."),
